	(text "OOMWOO wake-up sensor board (rev 1, 2026-11-15). A GL5537 photoresistor on its own small board, so it can sit where\nthe enclosure needs it. With the main board's 10k pull-down (R103) it forms a divider into PB12 (ADC):\nmore light = higher voltage. C1 (100 nF) on the main board filters noise picked up on the cable.\nRefs in the 7000s: each board has its own range."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ab81ee52-5d7f-4b6e-968d-5b5a2ab6f378")
	)
